"@spolitov Actually this might be a slightly broader (test only?) issue than just the TSAN race. Seems to trace back to something in this range:\r\n```\r\ngit log --oneline 3dbfa227e~..f9f906a5c\r\nf9f906a [#4395] Fix SnapshotTxnTest.MultiWriteWithRestart flakiness\r\ne8c8f9c [#4610] Fix TSAN issue with concurrent size cache update in TabletSnapshotOpRequestPB\r\n8dd936f [#4724] Change fatal/core alerts to be based on modification time, not change time\r\nf019707 [#4625] Adding total number of threads per stack trace\r\n449ba58 [#4610, #4302] Handle the case when a table is deleted during transaction aware snapshot creation\r\n8ab79a2 [#4524] Change status wait logic in intent aware iterator\r\n50a714a #4487: Detection of approximate middle DocKey for a tablet splitting\r\n9e1d756 #4755: Don't sync .git directory for remote build\r\nd343860 #4752: Update log message about closing idle connection\r\nda0272b [#2563, #2562] Enable binary_call_parser_reject_on_mem_tracker_hard_limit and rpc_throttle_threshold_bytes\r\n80e6ba1 [YW][#4754] Add logic to handle when universe tables are unavailable due to pending task.\r\ndfc2af2 Remove bitshuffle and bz2 dependencies, and fix flex/bison lookup\r\n3dbfa22 #4626: Remove StopWatch from compaction iterator\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe same range of commits made these go from 0 failures to failing across builds:\r\nhttps://detective-gcp.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?class=BackupTxnTest&name=Restart\r\nhttps://detective-gcp.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?class=BackupTxnTest&name=DeleteTableWithMastersRestart","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/649976932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bmatican","id":395011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTAxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395011?v=4","gravata